  "description": "The Shift R7 29\" is our new foray into All-Mountain \"'niner\" riding with a modern geometry and 12-speed components at an affordable price tag. Featuring our Shift R 29\" 140mm travel frame with our new 4-bar linkage design, up-to-date geometry and proprietary X6 aluminum tubing, the Shift R7 29\" model is equipped with the Sram SX 12-speed group featuring the DUB Boost crankset, derailleur, shifter and wide ratio 11-50T cassette for easy climbing and crisp shifting. With 150mm of front suspension provided by a Rockshox Recon RL fork and a specifically-tuned X-Fusion air rear shock, the Shift R7 with 29\" wheels easily rides over most obstacles. It will match a large variety of riding abilities with its steeper seat tube angle for more efficient pedaling when climbing, its slacker head tube angle at 66 degrees and longer reach for an improved riding position.",
